            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Holiday Baker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this tasted pretty good. I made it to use up some Thanksgiving turkey and homemade cranberry sauce I had made. I used lite mayo and butter and just added it to taste. I didn't think the ingredients all blended together, but what made this sandwich was the cranberry sauce. I will definitely use that as a condiment, in the future, on a turkey sandwich.",
            "datePublished": "2011-11-28T20:09:42.080Z"
